{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1381913-to-the-author-s-of-venice-unmasked","id":1381913,"title":"To the author[s] of Venice Unmasked:","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-04-16T07:09:07-07:00","id":1381913,"title":"To the author[s] of Venice Unmasked:","content":"Yesterday I purchased this excellent pdf from Storyteller's Vault, and I absolutely love it. It's clear a lot of love went into it. Buuuut, I have some questions:<br /> <br /> 1)Will you ever do a 2e version of Venice Unmasked? Don't get me wrong, converting between 1e and 2e <i>is</i> fairly simple, but still.<br /> <br /> 2)Any plans on a Venice sourcebook from the perspective of other splats?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","name":"Demigod Beast","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1154"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-16T08:09:20-07:00","id":1381922,"title":"","content":"Hi <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12219\" data-vbnamecard=\"12219\">Demigod Beast</a> - so glad you like it.<br /> <br /> So point 1 - yes I would love to update it. But there are a lot of characters to update in there. My first aim is the Court of Carnival Rules.<br /> Point 2 - I would love to - what would you like covered first?<br /> <br /> Mainly it is an issue of time as I work freelance for Cubicle 7 and some other things, so better paying gigs take precendence (plus my day job).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.darker-days.org\" target=\"_blank\">www.darker-days.org</a> - The Premier World of Darkness Podcast<br /> Co-designer and miniature painter for Noble Armada 3e<br /> Staff writer for CYBR Magazine <a href=\"https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/\" target=\"_blank\">https://shop.cybrmagazine.com/</a><br /> Writer, developer, editor, layout for Darker Days Radio Publishing<br /> Writer for Cubicle 7 Wrath and Glory Revised","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/128-dr-ether","name":"Dr Ether","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar128_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"292"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-16T08:35:11-07:00","id":1381927,"title":"","content":"Well, Kindred and mages in Venice have been...less-than-benevolent towards Venetian changelings, so that'd be cool to dive into.<br /> <br /> The temporal distortions could be looked into, from either a Demon or Mummy standpoint. Most changelings never escape Arcadia and suffer THAT level of time-lapse, but Venice is crawling with them. Maybe exploring why that is could be interesting. (Hell, it would be an interesting phenomenon if it happened to OTHER Venetian supernaturals!)<br /> <br /> EDIT: Plus, it'd be cool to really explore the Venetian Hedge in much greater detail, local Goblin Markets, Venetian hobgoblins, etc.<br /> <br /> EDIT2: Plus, some Sin-Eater material would be a cool follow-up to all the death the city's seen down the centuries. Etruscan Avernian Gates, for the win!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12219,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12219-demigod-beast","user":"Demigod Beast","date":". 04-16-2020, 09:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reaction